                                                                                                     "heading":  "Product Specifications",
                                                                                                     "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVacuum Magnetic Suction:\u003c/strong\u003e Securely mounts smartphones using a powerful magnetic block array and vacuum adsorption for exceptional holding strength—even on rough roads or uneven surfaces.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUniversal Compatibility : \u003c/strong\u003eWorks with all smartphones, including non-magnetic devices, thanks to the included magnetic ring for secured grip, ensuring a seamless and versatile hands-free solution for any user.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThree-Axis Linkage \u0026 Multi-Faceted Adjustment:\u003c/strong\u003e Features 360° bracket rotation and 180° flip options for the bracket and suction cup, allowing precise and flexible angle adjustment for optimal viewing and access in any position\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact \u0026 Foldable Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Easily folds into a portable form factor, making transport and storage convenient without any bulky components. Reliable mechanical vacuum lock fixes holder in place—no charging or adhesive required for operation, providing hassle-free installation and removal.\u003c/p\u003e"
                                                                                                 }
                                                                                },
                                                     "collapsible-row-1":  {
                                                                               "type":  "feature",
                                                                               "settings":  {
                                                                                                "heading":  "Product features",
                                                                                                "content":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Installation\u003c/strong\u003e: Features a strong Vacuum suction base for mounting on dashboards, windshields, or flat surfaces without leaving any residue.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh Load-Bearing Capacity:\u003c/strong\u003e Supports up to 5KG weight, ensuring phones, small tablets, or other devices are held firmly in place.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSturdy Zinc Alloy Support Arm:\u003c/strong\u003e High-quality support structure built from durable zinc alloy and alloy material for maximum stability and lasting use.\u003c/p\u003e",
