                                                                                                      "content":  "\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterials: \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eMade from premium-grade alloy (zinc alloy for the support arm, alloy+PC for body and parts) for durability, long-term use, and corrosion resistance.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCare Instructions:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eWipe clean with a soft, dry cloth to remove dust or fingerprints.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAvoid prolonged exposure to extreme heat or direct sunlight to prevent material degradation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEnsure magnetic surfaces remain free of debris for optimal suction and grip.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStore folded and away from moisture when not in use for best longevity.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIf needed, lightly clean with a damp cloth—do not immerse in water or use abrasive cleaners.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
